Date: Mon, 27 Jul 2026 23:29:46 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 12/13] chimera: recover display topology and sessions

Probe both downstream heads with the shared Vino decoder, debounce removal, recreate Revdi outputs after reattachment, and rebuild all owned state after a transport failure. Match the kernel control cadence, use the cursor-image wire identifier, and move disabled cursors off-screen.

